/*
 * Sticky keys: quick-release
 *
 * By default a sticky key stays active until the next key is *released*,
 * so fast rolls (e.g. sticky Shift -> "t" -> "h") can apply the modifier
 * to more than one key. quick-release turns the sticky key off as soon as
 * the next key is *pressed*, so it only applies to that one key.
 *
 * This overrides the built-in &sk, so every sticky key in the layout changes.
 */
&sk {
    quick-release;
};